#: destinations/live/_manage.php:954
msgid ""
"This is the time since your latest full Snapshot was taken by BackupBuddy "
"Stash Live. Stash Live continuously watches for changes and pushes them up "
"for safe storage. Periodically a \"Snapshot\" in time is created which is a "
"recording of the state of your site at that time. You can download your "
"latest Snapshot zip files from the Sync dashboard."
